// Confirms the fall guard now protects gotoLoopPf() DIRECTLY (not just via
// goTo()) — this is what skills.js's own gotoLoop() wrapper calls, used by
// ~20 skills incl. branchMine's digCorridorStep (the ORIGINAL 17-block
