559	// process EXCEPT whatever was in `preexistingJavaPids` -- a snapshot taken
560	// once at THIS bot's own boot(). That's only correct in a single-bot world:
561	// the moment a SECOND bot boots later, its pid was never in the first bot's
562	// snapshot, so shutting down/relaunching the FIRST bot sweeps up every bot
